flowchart TD
  A([HR creates onboarding request]) --> B[Validate mandatory fields and email]
  B --> C{Valid and not duplicate?}
  C -- No --> D[Return actionable validation errors]
  D --> A
  C -- Yes --> E[Route to hiring manager approval]
  E --> F{Approved?}
  F -- No --> G[Return to HR with reason]
  G --> A
  F -- Yes --> H[Publish validated onboarding event]
  H --> I[Integration maps HR fields to IAM schema]
  I --> J[Request least-privilege access]
  J --> K{Provisioning successful?}
  K -- No --> L[Log correlation ID; retry or IT escalation]
  L --> J
  K -- Yes --> M[Audit approval and provisioning evidence]
  M --> N[Notify HR, manager and IT]
  N --> O([Close onboarding request])
